DESCRIPTION >
    Setup & Health: most recent conversion, trailing 30d. Tenant-scoped; prunes
    via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of setup-doctor.js's queryHogQL
    call at api/lib/setup-doctor.js:70 (queryName 'doctor_last_conversion').
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id,
    event -> event_type, properties.conversion_type -> conversion_type (typed,
    DEFAULT 'untyped'). No JSON-bag fields in this query.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE doctor_last_conversion_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT timestamp, conversion_type
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
